#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Imagines vultus tui cum quibus Ubuntu Hello comparat. Serva saltem duas, "
"diversa luce recordatas."

#: src/main.ui:97
