#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Unum tantum exemplar vultus inscriptum est. Perspicilla, mutatio barbae vel "
"alia lux mutant quomodo camera vultum tuum videat, itaque unum exemplar "
"deficere potest (exempli gratia vespere sub lucernis). Alterum exemplar cum "
"perspicillis vel sine, cum altera specie tua, vel in alia luce adde ut "
"reseratio fida maneat."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Addere alterum exemplar"

