#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Rogare me ut capite adnuam ad confirmandum"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Postquam vultus congruit, nuntius te rogat ut capite adnuas. Imago ante "
"cameram ostensa adnuere non potest."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Reseratio automatica Keyring / KWallet"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Activa vultus agnitionem ut anulus clavium aditus tui vel KWallet, cum "
"ingrederis, sponte reserentur. Hoc tesseram tuam tuto reponit, intra TPM "
"obsignatam si praesto est, aut per AES-256-GCM occultatam clave principali "
"quae soli root patet. Vultus agnitio PAM_AUTHTOK ponit pro pam_gnome_keyring "
"vel pam_kwallet5, prout scrinium tuum fert."

